  '10VWuMFZolas0xI8UckuQJZ8WSNULE2ry',
  'Learning and Development (L&D) Calendar 2024



Creating a comprehensive Learning and Development (L&D) calendar for a company involves planning and scheduling various training and development initiatives throughout the year. Below is a sample L&D calendar for the year 2024. 

Please note that this is a general template, and you should customize it based on your company''s specific needs, industry, and workforce requirements.

Quarter 1: January - March

Month: January

Onboarding sessions for new hires.

Cybersecurity training for all employees.

Soft skills workshops (communication, teamwork, leadership).



Month: February

Diversity and inclusion training.

Technical skills refreshers for relevant departments.

Time management and productivity workshops.



Month: March

Project management training.

Health and wellness initiatives (mental health awareness, stress management).

Advanced Excel training for finance and data teams.

Quarter 2: April - June

Month: April

Customer service excellence training.

Innovation and creativity workshops.

Compliance and ethics training.



Month: May

Sales and negotiation skills training.

Cybersecurity awareness refresher.

Team-building activities and workshops.



Month: June

Leadership development programs.

Change management training.

Communication and conflict resolution workshops.

Quarter 3: July - September

Month: July

Technical certifications for IT and engineering teams.

Time management and goal-setting sessions.

Employee recognition and appreciation training.



Month: August

Data privacy and GDPR compliance training.

Sales strategy and market trends workshops.

Emotional intelligence training.



Month: September

Customer feedback and service improvement training.

Project management methodologies.

Cross-functional training sessions.

Quarter 4: October - December

Month: October

Advanced leadership programs.

IT security awareness training.

Effective communication in a virtual environment.



Month: November

Annual compliance training updates.

Remote work best practices.

Employee well-being and resilience workshops.



Month: December

Year-end review and reflection sessions.

Goal setting for the upcoming year.

Holiday-themed team-building activities.

Ongoing Throughout the Year:

Monthly Webinars:

Industry updates and emerging trends.

Guest speaker sessions on relevant topics.



Mentorship Programs:

Ongoing mentorship and coaching opportunities.



Learning Resources:

Access to online courses, articles, and learning materials.



Feedback and Evaluation:

Continuous feedback loops to assess the effectiveness of training programs.

Remember to regularly review and update the L&D calendar based on feedback, changing organizational needs, and emerging trends in the industry.',
  '2026-09-15T08:13:06.467+00:00'
) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

