  'Email to the most suitable candidate Hi [Candidate Name], Thank you for taking the time to talk to us about the [job title] position. It was a pleasure getting to meet you and we think that you’d be a good fit for this role. As a next step, we’d like to send you an assignment that simulates some of the job duties. It’ll give you the chance to better understand what the position entails and showcase your skills. If you agree, please reply to this email, and I’ll [send you the assignment along with the guidelines]. Also, feel free to reach out if you have any questions. Looking forward to hearing back from you, [Your name] [Your signature]',
  0,
