  'Ensured secure authentication, validation, and transaction handling Online Art Gallery Jul 2024 – Nov 2024 Django, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, MySQL – Built a web-based platform for artists to showcase and sell artwork online – Implemented role-based access for Admin, Artist, and Buyer – Developed exhibitions, artwork management, cart, and order processing features – Integrated secure online payment and order confirmation workflow Store Management System – Mini Project Feb 2024 – Mar 2024 HTML, CSS, Laravel, XAMPP – Developed a role-based store management system with separate dashboards for different users – Implemented inventory management and basic store operations Retail Billing System Jul 2023 – Aug 2023 HTML, CSS, PHP – Developed a billing system to generate customer bills automatically – Implemented product-based billing logic and invoice generation Technical Skills Languages: JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, C, C++, SQL, Java, DS Frontend: Angular, React, HTML, CSS Backend: Node.js, Express, Django, ASP.NET Databases: MongoDB, MySQL, SQL Server Tools: Git, GitHub, Stripe, VS Code Certifications Generative AI for Software Developers March 2026 Coursera IBM Introduction to Data Analytics March 2026 Coursera IBM Interactivity with JavaScript Jan 2023 Coursera Relational Database Systems (RDBMS) Feb 2023 Coursera Dynamic Web Application Development (PHP & MySQL) Jun 2023 Coursera Problem Solving using Computational Thinking Nov 2022 Coursera Object-Oriented Programming with Java Mar 2024 Coursera Introduction to Cybersecurity Essentials Mar 2025 Coursera Build Your First Android App Apr 2025 Coursera Web Development and Testing with Selenium Nov 2025 Coursera Foundations of Cybersecurity Jan 2026 Coursera Areas of Interest Full-Stack Web Development Backend Development and REST APIs Database Design and Management Secure Web Applications and Payments',
